  },
  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Les dents du gardien du Parc Safari, à lui redonner contre la CS04.",
      "short_effect": "Le dentier du Gardien du Parc Safari. À échanger contre la CS04 (Force).",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "The Safari Zone warden’s teeth, to be returned to him for HM04.",
      "short_effect": "The Safari Zone Warden’s dentures. Trade for HM04 (Strength).",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "Gold dentures lost\nby the SAFARI\nZONE’s WARDEN.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "emerald",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/6/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A set of false teeth lost by the\nSAFARI ZONE’S WARDEN. It makes his\nsmile sparkle.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "firered-leafgreen",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/7/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "サファリゾーンの　えんちょうが\nおとした　きんいろの　いれば。\nわらうと　とても　まぶしい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "사파리존의 원장이\n떨어뜨린 금색 틀니.\n웃으면 매우 눈부시다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "狩獵地帶的園長\n遺失的金色假牙。\n裝上它之後笑起來非常耀眼。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un dentier en or perdu par le directeur du Parc Safari.\nIl lui donne un sourire étincelant.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein vergoldeter Zahnersatz, den der Direktor der\nSafari-Zone verlegt hat. Setzt er ihn ein, verleiht\ner ihm buchstäblich ein goldiges Lächeln.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Unos dientes de oro que perdió el Guarda de la Zona\nSafari con los que tiene una sonrisa deslumbrante.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dentiera dorata persa dal guardiano della Zona Safari.\nRende il suo sorriso davvero scintillante.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A set of golden false teeth lost by the Safari Zone’s\nwarden. They make his smile sparkle.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "サファリゾーンの　園長が\n落とした　金色の　入れ歯。\n笑うと　とても　まぶしい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "狩猎地带的园长遗失的金假牙。\n装上它后，笑起来十分耀眼。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
